
You should enter the level at which you wish the system to prompt 
you for input. The following levels of help are supported: 

   N : Novice. All menus are shown completely. Prompts are shown
               in their 'long' form with lists of available options.

   J : Junior. Same as novice, but a menu may be interrupted by
               starting to type the next command.

   E : Expert. Prompts are shown in a generally shorter form.

   S : Super.  Prompts are shown in their shortest form.

Online help using the question mark is available with all modes. 

